      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE LAST TRIP (5) comes to Sydney with a growing reputation, adding to a good strike rate by journeying to Adelaide for a dominant win in the SA Cup last start. Drops in trip but won the only time he attempted the mile. The one to beat. SAINT CRUSADER (9) came from a similar barrier to win at this circuit and distance back in September and has been racing well since, chasing the mighty Swayzee as runner-up last week. He looks the best of the challengers. COOL NIGHT (2) draws much better than last week and came from this barrier for fourth to the smart Dangerous here prior. DESSIE GEE (6) and DANCE WITH CARMER (10) are both good enough to feature if things go their way.",
